- **`CustomerCode.java`** — `of(Owner)` builds `'<REGION>-<HASH8>'` (region from `Locality`, HASH8 = first 8 upper-hex of SHA-256 over telephone+lastName). `dedupe(code, existingCodes)` appends `-<n>` on collision. `region(customerCode)` returns everything before the last `-`. (Note: the Javadoc/openapi description mentions an older `<CITY3>-<LAST3>-<NNNN>` scheme; the code implements the region/hash scheme.)
